<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Email alerts - Timecard Portal</title>
    <%- headTags %>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>
    <h1>Email alerts</h1>
    <p class="sub">When a repair moves to <strong>Repaired - Ready for Pickup</strong>, the portal can email the address on the ticket. It sends through the Resend email service.</p>
    <% if (flash) { %><div class="msg <%= flash.bad ? 'bad' : 'ok' %>" role="status"><%= flash.msg %></div><% } %>

    <div class="panel">
        <h3>Status</h3>
        <p><span class="badge <%= configured ? 'ok' : 'warn' %>"><%= configured ? 'Ready to send' : 'Not set up yet' %></span></p>
        <ul class="plain">
            <li>Email service key (<code>RESEND_API_KEY</code>): <%= keySet ? 'set' : 'missing' %></li>
            <li>Sender address (<code>MAIL_FROM</code>): <%= fromSet ? from : 'missing' %></li>
            <li>Always copy (<code>NOTIFY_CC</code>): <%= cc.length ? cc.join(', ') : 'nobody' %></li>
            <li>Pickup note (<code>PICKUP_NOTE</code>): <%= pickup || 'none' %></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <% if (configured) { %>
    <form class="panel" action="/bench/email/test" method="POST">
        <h3>Send a test</h3>
        <label for="to">Send to</label>
        <input type="email" id="to" name="to" required maxlength="120" placeholder="you@example.com">
        <button type="submit">Send test email</button>
    </form>
    <% } %>

    <div class="panel">
        <h3>Set it up</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Ask IT whether the district is happy with email going out from a service like Resend, and which address it should come from. Emails to <code>@sd5.k12.mt.us</code> addresses may be filtered, so test with a real student address.</li>
            <li>Create a free account at resend.com, verify the domain you want to send from, and create an API key.</li>
            <li>In Render, open this service &rarr; <strong>Environment</strong> and add:
                <ul>
                    <li><code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> &mdash; the key you created</li>
                    <li><code>MAIL_FROM</code> &mdash; for example <code>Tech Bench &lt;bench@yourdomain.org&gt;</code></li>
                    <li><code>NOTIFY_CC</code> (optional) &mdash; addresses that get every pickup email, separated by commas</li>
                    <li><code>PICKUP_NOTE</code> (optional) &mdash; a line added to each email, such as where to pick the device up</li>
                </ul></li>
            <li>Save. Render restarts; come back here and send a test.</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="hint">Each ticket has its own &ldquo;Email for pickup alerts&rdquo; box (in Edit details, or when you create the ticket). With no address there and nobody in <code>NOTIFY_CC</code>, nothing is sent. The email names the device and ticket number and the student's first name only.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
